Rhiza OS Template
version: 2026.09-v4
released: 2026-09-22

What changed in this version, in plain words:

- The system saves itself every hour, set up during onboarding and proven
  in the same minute rather than an hour later.
- knowledge/core/ holds what the business is, sells, serves and sounds
  like. Every draft is built from it, and it changes only on the owner's
  word.
- New skills: pickup (opens a session), write-like-me (drafts in the
  owner's voice from real samples of their writing).
- The handoff close now files facts, takes a journal note, sweeps
  corrections, and saves safely instead of just committing.
- A quality bar that runs before anything reaches a person, rather than
  sitting in a folder nobody opens.
- Onboarding walks the business room by room and collects a voice bank.

Your OS records this version number in decisions.md when it installs, so
you can always tell which template you started from.
